    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "d0ca7af1-8856-3c64-b88f-57b747397fe2",
                "word": "Melchior",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8207ad31-d702-3d9c-984b-536a61797ca0",
                        "entry_id": "d0ca7af1-8856-3c64-b88f-57b747397fe2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One of the Magi according to medieval Christian legend."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3b1ad24b-73b3-3fb4-9a9b-8fa479fedf01",
                        "entry_id": "d0ca7af1-8856-3c64-b88f-57b747397fe2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A male given name from Hebrew."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2cc3690-f4b2-4764-abfe-bd5fae47d484",
                                "sense_id": "3b1ad24b-73b3-3fb4-9a9b-8fa479fedf01",
                                "text": "So twin boys, our fathers, were born in the USA. Melchior and Peregrine. What names, eh? What delusions of grandeur went into the naming of them? If you shorten them to 'Mel' and 'Perry', they've got a democratically twentieth-century and transatlantic ring to them."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "987bcc97-120b-42b6-8409-d3b913ec60d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "d0ca7af1-8856-3c64-b88f-57b747397fe2",
                        "source_sense_description": "one of the Magi",
                        "target_lang_word": "Melchior",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Melchior",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f5a7760-3e0b-3812-8b49-71bb454bc3f9",
                                        "entry_id": "e0f6710f-5c0f-3f45-8b6a-ed9512458eed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "L’un des trois mages du Nouveau Testament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "935bf24c-9f4c-49a2-9b93-c16ca40598de",
                                                "sense_id": "0f5a7760-3e0b-3812-8b49-71bb454bc3f9",
                                                "text": "Gaspard, Melchior et Balthazar."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Melchior",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bd497f6-b025-39f6-b9fb-dbae48b4a43d",
                                        "entry_id": "6ba428f0-554b-354e-a3db-e674589edcd2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Prénom masculin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28aee167-925d-4d9a-8b63-fa6294686b2e",
                                                "sense_id": "7bd497f6-b025-39f6-b9fb-dbae48b4a43d",
                                                "text": "Un inventaire minutieux fut dressé de tout ce qu’il possédait sur lui, on nota les pièces d’argent dans ses poches, on inscrivit le velours de son manteau, on porta mention des jabots de sa chemise, on le fit déchausser, déculotter, déchemiser, dénuder entièrement, une ordure entrouvrit l’orifice pour y chercher une pierre précieuse, Melchior lui aurait pété à la figure !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Melchior",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "33a14229-b681-39ce-bba3-dc5de8779e57",
                                        "entry_id": "1b3be149-47f2-3443-bd07-a6dadd03caef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de famille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa50c416-967f-4099-bc45-b9d9b64facca",
                                                "sense_id": "33a14229-b681-39ce-bba3-dc5de8779e57",
                                                "text": "On n’est pas d'accord sur tout, mais on est dans la continuité des retraites, abonde Diego Melchior, secrétaire général CFDT Île-de-France."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "062816d4-1f60-4b6f-886b-d9ad53c26cbd",
                                                "sense_id": "33a14229-b681-39ce-bba3-dc5de8779e57",
                                                "text": "Interroger la complexité des espaces carcéraux à la suite de David Scheer, Laurent Solini et Jennifer Yeghicheyan permet de mettre en perspective le surinvestissement des prisons en missions contradictoires (punir, réinsérer, neutraliser, dissuader, soigner, éduquer, déradicaliser…) et en objectifs contraires (ultra-sécuriser et humaniser) pour suivre Philippe Melchior et Omar Zanna à propos des nouvelles prisons."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
